# Installed on the server as /etc/cron.d/golden-grape-jobs (mode 644): Golden Grape scheduled jobs
# (docs/02-ARCHITECTURE.md §7). Daily: catering quotations past their validity become "Expiré"; at 07:00 the
# low-stock e-mail (M3.1 T6); loyalty points past their validity expire (M3.2 T3); Google reviews refreshed (M3.3 T1). Every minute: messages
# queued for the till are sent (M3.3 T5; nothing to do while the POS module is off), logged apart to keep the main log readable. Times are the server's clock: it must run on Europe/Luxembourg time
# (timedatectl set-timezone Europe/Luxembourg), or shift the hours.
SHELL=/bin/sh
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
30 2 * * * root /usr/local/bin/gg-job quotations-expire >> /var/log/gg-jobs.log 2>&1
0 7 * * * root /usr/local/bin/gg-job low-stock-digest >> /var/log/gg-jobs.log 2>&1
45 2 * * * root /usr/local/bin/gg-job loyalty-expire >> /var/log/gg-jobs.log 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/local/bin/gg-job outbox-process >> /var/log/gg-outbox.log 2>&1
